# Everything below is OPTIONAL. The default grader is a local model through Ollama,
# which needs no key and no account:
#
#   ollama pull llama3.2:3b
#   uv run mainscheck run --model llama3.2:3b
#
# Fill these in only if you want to grade with a hosted Anthropic model instead
# (`--grader anthropic`). Copy this file to .env first; .env is gitignored.
#
# NEVER put a real key in THIS file. It is tracked by git and will be published.
# Never paste a key into a chat transcript or an issue either. If a key has been
# somewhere it can be read, revoke it.

# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
#
# Only needed when the key is not scoped to a single workspace. A workspace-scoped
# key does not need this.
# ANTHROPIC_WORKSPACE_ID=
#
# Override if Ollama does not listen on http://127.0.0.1:11434
# OLLAMA_HOST=
